  "path_redaction": "Only the absolute workspace prefix in pinned-delivery.log changed, in 3 fields, to <fixture-workspace>. Its source and export hashes are distinct. Every other file is byte-identical to its source commit. The traces are published as recorded: the program_artifacts section of each names the three program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran them.",
  "source_files": "The seven files under source/ are the build inputs whose hashes are not already published, copied byte for byte at the program_source commit. Their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in the traces' build_inputs. The other 62 build inputs are identical to the files under ../source/. The base commit's program source is the source under ../source/ with the six files under ../pinned-terms/source/ at their paths. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them."
